      <common:UUID>72d2f696-7aa6-499a-9fde-7ebbe773279f</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Natural gypsum, sludge use, Lombardy Region </baseName>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Produzione gesso naturale a uso fanghi </common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Non-energetic raw materials</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>Dataset developed within the ARCADIA project in the context of the PhD of Federica Carollo (Politecnico di Milano). 
The dataset relates to the production of 1 kg of gypsum-based materials. 
The dataset is composed of 3-unit processes:  
1)  Extraction of natural gypsum (Process: Natural gypsum, extraction, Lombardy Region); 
2)  Treatment of natural gypsum (Natural gypsum, treatment for sludge production); 
3) Transport to the defecation plant. </common:generalComment>
      <referenceToExternalDocumentation type="source data set" refObjectId="4513203f-b76e-4f4b-9294-a50a58716460" version="01.00.000" uri="../sources/4513203f-b76e-4f4b-9294-a50a58716460.xml">
        <common:shortDescription>Carollo F. (2023). Circularity in construction and demolition waste management chain, Ph.D. Dissertation (Tutored by Rigamonti L., Ceruti F.). Politecnico di Milano. Background datasets from the EcoInvent database cut-off (v. 3.8) were used for the LCA study. </common:shortDescription>
      </referenceToExternalDocumentation>
    </dataSetInformation>
